      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "PPG Industries’ former Pittsburgh Plate Glass factory in Charleroi once employed up to a thousand workers, ranking it among the world’s largest glass plants.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
